hangs down past her waist in a single braid.  Beautiful green eyes serenely
stare at you, sending a chill down your spine.  Her wide smile ends at her very
pointy ears.  Her shimmering sleeveless dress appears to be beaded with
emeralds, but it makes no noise as she moves.  It ends just above the ankle,
revealing her long and thin bare feet.  The neckline is low enough for you to
